{"id":"fdadd493aba9167e","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-truth-complexity.md","title":"Π¹₁ 句的真值复杂度","display":"df-truth-complexity — Π¹₁ 句的真值复杂度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-truth-complexity","aliases":["18-df-truth-complexity","18-df-043"],"display":"df-truth-complexity — Π¹₁ 句的真值复杂度","depends_on":["[[18-df-verification-calculus]]","[[18-df-church-kleene-ordinal]]","[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","[[18-df-analytic-prenex-formula]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Definition 5.4.10","source_pages":"81–82","source_pdf_pages":"91–92","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check","prior_revision_verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-truth-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-truth-complexity</span><span>18-df-043</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-complexity — Π¹₁ 句的真值复杂度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"42776dd9b2915027\" href=\"?note=42776dd9b2915027\" title=\"18-df-verification-calculus\">18-df-verification-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e5ab7fce1b232e4\" href=\"?note=5e5ab7fce1b232e4\" title=\"18-df-church-kleene-ordinal\">18-df-church-kleene-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5108757a70d00b41\" href=\"?note=5108757a70d00b41\" title=\"18-df-analytic-prenex-formula\">18-df-analytic-prenex-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 5.4.10"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"81–82"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"91–92"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^\\alpha\">\\(V^\\alpha\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"42776dd9b2915027\" href=\"?note=42776dd9b2915027\" title=\"18-df-verification-calculus\">18-df-verification-calculus</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\">\\(\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e5ab7fce1b232e4\" href=\"?note=5e5ab7fce1b232e4\" title=\"18-df-church-kleene-ordinal\">18-df-church-kleene-ordinal</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^\\nabla\">\\(F^\\nabla\\)</span> 在有限公式树上递归，收集顶层析取分支。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F),\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F),\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5108757a70d00b41\" href=\"?note=5108757a70d00b41\" title=\"18-df-analytic-prenex-formula\">18-df-analytic-prenex-formula</a>；前者包含全部自由集合变量的所有无重复全称闭包，后者是按固定枚举选取的代表。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tc}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{tc}_0\\)</span> 是矩阵上的序数值函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tc}\">\\(\\mathrm{tc}\\)</span> 为下式的关系图，其域包含矩阵及它的全部全称集合闭包；不把定义域收缩为单一排列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\">\\(\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\)</span> 保留为没有较小验证高度时的默认值，不假设公式为真，也不增加理论可靠性前提。空集合量词块时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)=F\">\\(\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)=F\\)</span>，两组图对该输入给出同一值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F^\\nabla\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nG^\\nabla\\cup H^\\nabla&amp;F=(G\\lor H),\\\\\n\\{F\\}&amp;F\\notin\\{G\\lor H\\mid G,H\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F^\\nabla\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nG^\\nabla\\cup H^\\nabla&amp;F=(G\\lor H),\\\\\n\\{F\\}&amp;F\\notin\\{G\\lor H\\mid G,H\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tc}_0(F)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\bigl(\\{\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}:V^\\alpha(F^\\nabla)\\}\\cup\\{\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{tc}_0(F)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\bigl(\\{\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}:V^\\alpha(F^\\nabla)\\}\\cup\\{\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Dom}_{\\mathrm{tc}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\cup\\bigcup_{F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}}\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{tc}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle F,\\mathrm{tc}_0(F)\\rangle:F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle G,\\mathrm{tc}_0(F)\\rangle:F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ G\\in\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{tc}&amp;:\\mathrm{Dom}_{\\mathrm{tc}}\\longrightarrow\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}+1,\\\\\n\\mathrm{tc}(F)&amp;=\\mathrm{tc}(\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F))=\\mathrm{tc}_0(F)\n\\quad(F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}),\\\\\n\\forall F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\;\\forall G\\in\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)\\quad\n\\mathrm{tc}(G)&amp;=\\mathrm{tc}_0(F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Dom}_{\\mathrm{tc}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\cup\\bigcup_{F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}}\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{tc}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle F,\\mathrm{tc}_0(F)\\rangle:F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle G,\\mathrm{tc}_0(F)\\rangle:F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ G\\in\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{tc}&amp;:\\mathrm{Dom}_{\\mathrm{tc}}\\longrightarrow\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}+1,\\\\\n\\mathrm{tc}(F)&amp;=\\mathrm{tc}(\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F))=\\mathrm{tc}_0(F)\n\\quad(F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}),\\\\\n\\forall F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\;\\forall G\\in\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)\\quad\n\\mathrm{tc}(G)&amp;=\\mathrm{tc}_0(F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按 Definition 5.4.10 修复。旧稿假设每个 Π¹₁ 句有“canonical finite approximation φ[n]”，没有给出构造，且与前一节点重复占用同一符号。原书用 ω 完备的验证演算、顶层析取导出及 Church–Kleene 序数作失败哨兵；不是任意有限近似证明高度的上确界。候选集合含哨兵，故最小值总存在。</p>\n<p>集合量词前缀的不同排列都保留在函数图中，并按同一矩阵取值；固定枚举只决定显示代表。算术矩阵没有集合量词，剥去外层集合量词块后矩阵唯一。空前缀的闭包与矩阵相同，两个图分支给出相同值，因此不依赖 Remark 以外的额外等价类约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-verification-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"42776dd9b2915027","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-verification-cal