F))=\\mathrm{tc}_0(F)\n\\quad(F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}),\\\\\n\\forall F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\;\\forall G\\in\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F)\\quad\n\\mathrm{tc}(G)&=\\mathrm{tc}_0(F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3340,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-truth-complexity]]"},{"id":"2053b1b724a60f4e","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PRTerm}_2,\\operatorname{ev}$ 见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]，$\\operatorname{otyp}(R)$ 与 $\\mathrm{WF}(R)$ 见 [[18-df-church-kleene-ordinal]]；它们采用一般良基关系秩，不擅自增加线性假设。$\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}$ 见 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]；$\\mathrm{tc}$ 见 [[18-df-truth-complexity]]。$R_a(s,t)$、$\\mathrm{Prog}$、$\\mathrm{TI}_{\\mathbb N}$ 是 Tait 公式构造；$\\to$ 按 $\\sim A\\lor B$ 展开。源数变量枚举 $x_i$ 取同一 Tait 语言节点。下式两个归纳模板的绑定变量固定为 $x_0,x_1$，不再从任意不同变量中另作选择；$s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathrm{NT}}$，$X\\in\\mathcal X$ 为自由一元参数；$\\overline1$ 是源语言数码。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-truth-complexity]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-truth-complexity]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-truth-complexity|18-df-truth-complexity]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-truth-complexity|18-df-truth-complexity]]"}],"outgoing":["42776dd9b2915027","5e5ab7fce1b232e4","7ddb1b71680edcd2","5108757a70d00b41"]}